<title>POLAND: PLI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 9.</title>
<headline>PLI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 650,000 shares in wholesaler and retailer PLI SA at nine zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session PLI traded at 10.3 zlotys in a volume of 19,374 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
